# MicroDuck working tree: publish source, docs and small data only.
# Nested repositories keep their own history; CAD, slices, images, archives and
# generated per-pose study data stay local (regenerate them from the scripts).
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!*.py
!*.md
!*.sh
!*.command
!*.mjs
!*.js
!*.ts
!*.css
!*.json
!*.jsonl
!*.txt
!*.dts
!*.dtso
!*.c
!*.cpp
!*.h
!*.hpp
!*.ino
!*.toml
!*.yaml
!*.yml
!*.cfg
!*.csv
!*.svg
!*.xml
!*.urdf
!*.service
!guide/viewer/template.html
!bringup/build/template.html

# Nested repositories (own history) and local-only folders.
/cloud-share/
/microduck-beak-lab/
/microduck-simulator/
/microduck_rl/
/Microduck-build-tutorial/
/microduck-rl-contribution/
/extensions/rl-physics-overlay/
/team-share-20261001/
/.work/
/HANDOFF-*.md
node_modules/
__pycache__/
.ruff_cache/
dist/
guide/data/guide-data.json

